r Bond、Bumping、Tim、Mold、BG、Dicing中的某段工艺制程完成工艺开发工作；\n4.项目/任务成果：主导完成至少2个工艺开发或良率改善项目，具有工艺窗口构建与良率提升的交付成果；\n5.其他要求：具有跨节点或跨部门的协作经验，能系统化分析并解决复杂工艺问题，在技术沟通中主动对齐需求并推进落实，认同公司价值观。","ClassificationOne":"电路设计类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-17T14:21:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"493bec9e-899f-4cc2-9acd-ab7070561cd5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621170508,"PostDateInt":1794444187000,"PostDate":"2026-11-12T08:43:07","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"AI验证工程师-AI Verification Engineer(J21739)","OrgId":700528271,"Org":"Design-VE","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","陕西省·西安市","安徽省·合肥市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. AI工具引入与验证优化：联合产品及系统部门，引入并开发AI工具，完善设计验证的完整度与自动化水平；\n2. 流程自动化优化：完善并优化验证实现流程，推动自动化工具与脚本的开