Hammer评估等），能使用数据分析工具完成可靠性数据建模与失效模式识别；\n3. 行业与专业经验：具备5年以上存储行业产品整合或可靠性开发经验，有从设计到量产的产品全生命周期可靠性验证与良率管理经历；\n4. 项目/任务成果：主导完成至少2个存储产品的可靠性认证或良率提升项目，推动综合良率提升幅度超过10%，形成完整的闭环交付记录；\n5. 其他要求：具备跨部门沟通协作与复杂问题推动能力，具有较强的逻辑分析与技术文档输出能力，能独立完成技术报告撰写与客户审核对接。","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":"北京","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-30T17:44:05","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d835d54a-abaf-43dd-aa83-53f7e425dc5e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621162347,"PostDateInt":1793166462000,"PostDate":"2026-10-28T13:47:42","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"DRAM电路设计工程师-DRAM Circuit Design Engineer(J21562)","OrgId":700013881,"Org":"DE-DDR","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·合肥市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 存储架构评估与优化：评估并优化前沿技术中的存储架构与方法论，推动产品性能与效率提升；\n2. 全定制电路设计：设计存储产品中IP模块的全定制电路，确保电路性能与功耗目标达成；\n3. 功能与性能验证分析：对存储器的功能与性能进行仿真、验证与分析，确保设计满足规格要求；\n4. 版图设计与验证管控：监督版图设计与验证流程，包括floor-planning、布局布线及物理验证；\n5. 硅片调试支持：为产品工程团队提供硅片调试的技术支持，推动问题定位与解决。","Require":"1. 教育背景与专业知识：硕士及以上学历，微电子、集成电路或相关专业毕业，深入理解数字/模拟电路及CMOS器件物理；\n2. 专业技能与资格：能使用Spectre、finesim、Hspice、Virtuoso、Calibre等EDA工具完成电路设计与仿真，具备混合信号电路设计与验证经验，包括电路实现、时序分析与优化；\n3. 行业与专业经验：有存储器设计经验者优先，有DDR/LPDDR DRAM产品设计与验证经验者优先；\n4. 项目/任务成果：主导或深度参与过至少一款存储芯片的全定制电路设计，包括从架构评估到版图验证的完整流程；有ASIC设计背景（如RTL编码、STA等）者优先；\n5. 其他要求：具有良好的团队协作与沟通能力，学习能力强，能在灵活、动态的环境中保持自驱力。","ClassificationOne":"电路设计类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-28T13:47:42","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"8a29af94-d443-4e43-bd8a-2b3900c3da11","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621159616,"Pos